  "steps": [
   "Heat the oven to 200°C (180°C fan). Warm the oil in the frying pan over a medium heat. Add the potatoes and onion, cover and cook for 12 minutes, stirring now and then, until the potatoes are tender.",
   "Stir in the chard stalks and garlic and cook for 3 minutes, then add the leaves and stir until they wilt.",
   "Whisk the eggs with the crème fraîche, dill, salt and plenty of black pepper.",
   "Break the haddock into chunks and tuck them among the vegetables. Pour over the eggs, scatter with the cheddar and cook on the hob for 3 minutes, until the edges start to set.",
